# MCP tools

- One responsibility per tool. Strict Pydantic / JSON Schema.
- Enumerate parameters; cap time range, limit, timeout, and response size.
- Return structured errors: called tool, safe params, time range, error type, retryable, suggested fix.
- Classify every tool as Read, Propose, or Mutate. Agent gets Read and Propose only.
- Filter and redact on the server. Spill large payloads to artifacts.
- Do not expose PromQL/LogQL/Shell as the default interface.
- Add a contract test for schema, Azure compatibility, bounds, and timeout.
- Load `skills/mcp-toolset/SKILL.md` before adding or changing a tool.
